<title>UK: UK Treasury says Nov PSBR in line forecast for year.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury says Nov PSBR in line forecast for year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said November PSBR figures were fully in line with the government meeting its forecast of a 26.4 billion stg PSBR for 1996-7.</p>
<p>DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>===========</p>
<p>UK NOVEMBER PSBR 2.6 BLN STG, PRIVATISATION RECEIPTS NEGLIGIBLE</p>
<p>UK NOVEMBER CUMULATIVE PSBR 17.8 BLN STG VS 22.5 BLN IN NOVEMBER 1995</p>
</text>
